# Commentor comments for test/core.lisp
# This file pairs with the source file under .comments.d/<source>.cmt.
# Marker: @N or @N-M, optionally followed by [a=start anchor,b=end anchor].
# Get Commentor: https://commentor.myridia.com/

@1
The text buffer: line, buffer, and the five functions the tests call.

@12
line: one line is a list of characters.

@15
buffer: cursor, line-index, offset, lines.

@21
line-text: flatten one line to a string.

@24
text: flatten the whole buffer to a list of strings.

@28
insert-char: insert at the cursor, then step right.

@39
delete-char: delete the character AT the cursor.

@50
move: move the cursor, clamped to the line.
